.It Ic @undivert Oo Ar N No ... Oc No | Ar N FILE
Inject stream
.Va N
(default all) into current stream.
If no arguments are provided then all streams are injected.
With second form, stream
.Va N
is output to
.Va FILE .
After a stream has been undiverted, it is implicitly cleared.
See the
.Sx Streams and Diversions
section.
.It Ic @unless Ar EXPR No ... Oo Ic @else No ... Oc Ic @endif
Include subsequent text if
.Va EXPR
is False.
If
.Va EXPR
is a simple NAME, check if NAME\ ==\ 0 (or undefined).
See section
.Sx Boolean Expressions .
.It Ic @until Ar EXPR No ... Ic @endwhile
Repeatedly evaluate input lines while boolean expression
.Va EXPR
is False and stop when it becomes True.
.It Ic @while Ar EXPR No ... Ic @endwhile
Repeatedly evaluate input lines while boolean expression
.Va EXPR
is True and stop when it becomes False.
